        <p style="text-indent: 6em" rend="first-line-indent(6)"><seg source="#source-149432-149474">合計　　　　二八</seg><hi rend="small-script right" snh:layout-kind="small-script" snh:layout-params="position=right" source="#source-149474-149519"><seg source="#source-149474-149480">ドル</seg></hi><seg source="#source-149519-149533">・一二五</seg></p>
